<title>UK: C&amp;W Comms has 92.6 pct of NYNEX CableComms.</title>
<headline>C&amp;W Comms has 92.6 pct of NYNEX CableComms.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>NYNEX CableComms Group said on Tuesday that Cable &amp; Wireless Communications Plc had acceptances for 92.6 percent of NYNEX CableComms Group Inc and NYNEX CableComms Plc.</p>
<p>Cable &amp; Wireless Communications, Britain's new cable telephone and television company, has been formed by the merger of the Mercury subsidiary of Cable &amp; Wireless Plc with the three cable units of NYNEX Corp and Bell Canada.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
